		["North-west of Valanaar along the road: {npc:273017} watches the {quest:98512}; the dead cultist lies just north of him."] = "沿著道路前往瓦拉納爾西北方：{npc:273017}監視著{quest:98512}；死去的教徒就躺在他北邊。",
		["Prideclaws and Galestriders"] = "群爪與逐風者",
