		["Crusader's Outpost"] = "十字軍前哨",
		["Dry Branches"] = "乾樹枝",
		["Duskbats and Darkhounds roam all along the road back west; finish the wings and hides on the way."] = "夜行蝙蝠和黑暗犬在往西的回程道路沿線遊蕩；順路把翅膀和外皮收集完。",
